{"unit_id":"penguin-oo__dsh-bookmarks#card-zh","repo":"penguin-oo/dsh-bookmarks","commit":"56f6767e9fb8b825f975923ef499e4cf88c50942","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bookmarks 是 DSH Web 回复收藏插件，可在已完成的助手回复旁添加收藏并填写备注和标签。它通过 bookmarks Remote 服务将数据保存到 DSH storage domain，并提供跨会话收藏中心。用户可搜索收藏、按标签筛选、编辑或删除条目、返回原会话，也能将收藏导出为 Markdown。适合希望整理对话内容的 Web 用户；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:62-80","lib/index.js:145-230","src/client/index.jsx:899-970"]}
{"unit_id":"penguin-oo__dsh-bookmarks#card-en","repo":"penguin-oo/dsh-bookmarks","commit":"56f6767e9fb8b825f975923ef499e4cf88c50942","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-bookmarks lets DSH Web users save finalized assistant replies with notes and tags. Its cross-session center supports search, tag filtering, editing, deletion, returning to a session, and Markdown export. Bookmarks use the DSH storage domain; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:62-80","lib/index.js:145-230","src/client/index.jsx:899-970"]}
